### Banking Transactions API — sample requests
### Open in PhpStorm / WebStorm / IntelliJ (built-in HTTP Client) and click ▶ next to each request.
### Run top to bottom: later requests depend on earlier deposits.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Deposit (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### 2. Transfer (201) — saves the new id for request 7
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

> {% client.global.set("transferId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. Withdrawal (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 25,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### 4. Insufficient funds (422) — attempt is recorded with status "failed"
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 9999,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### 5. Validation errors (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-1",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -10.555,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### 6. List all transactions (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### 7. Get transaction by id (200) — uses the id from request 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transferId}}

### 8. Unknown transaction (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/does-not-exist

### 9. Filter by account
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### 10. Filter by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=transfer

### 11. Filter by date range (the "to" day is inclusive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### 12. Combined filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=transfer&from=2024-01-01

### 13. Account balance (per currency)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### 14. Account summary (Task 4A)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### 15. Invalid account id (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/12345/balance
